publication.podcast_description:
Soulthentic is the frequency of 'soul’ and ‘authentic’ combined to emphasize that it is your soul’s purpose to align with your authentic self and radical truth. When living Soulthentically, we are lit up and bring that fire into daily lives. Join Dr. Linh Love and other visionaries, healers &amp; artists who are paving the way on their individual paths. Through inspiring conversations that educate, empower, uplift &amp; shift, I hope to create positive change in your life and others. Now let’s connect, share, grow, and heal together.

With love, Dr. Linh 
